                          "key": "job_id",
                          "value": "<string>",
                          "description": "(Required) The job ID to cancel"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    "description": "Cancels a scenario creation job that is queued or processing.\n\n- **Queued jobs**: Marked as cancelled immediately\n- **Processing jobs**: The background task is terminated and the job is marked cancelled\n- **Completed/failed/cancelled jobs**: Returns 400 error (cannot cancel terminal states)"
